  "abstract": "{\"business_domain\":[\"巨量千川-素材管理\",\"巨量营销-素材与创意\"],\"business_line\":[\"巨量千川\",\"巨量营销\"],\"capability_summary\":\"将视频文件通过连山云素材服务上传后获取到视频文件链接，再将获取到的连山云视频文件url作为入参的video_url通过素材库提供的视频上传接口进行文件上传。仅支持开发者购置连山云素材服务上传生成的tos链接/连山点播云产品的视频链接上传，不支持其他三方链接地址。\",\"id\":\"file.upload_task.create\",\"interface_path\":\"/open_api/2/file/upload_task/create/\",\"method\":\"POST\",\"official_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/markdown/get/?language=CHINESE\\u0026doc_id=1849924274825865\",\"related_docs\":[{\"id\":\"get.access_token\",\"path\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710505596940\",\"reason\":\"需要先获取授权access_token才能调用此接口\",\"relation\":\"前置接口\",\"title\":\"获取Access token\"}],\"risk_level\":\"medium\",\"schema_url\":\"https://open.oceanengine.com/skiff/api/doc/client/schema/markdown/get/?doc_id=1849924274825865\",\"supplemental_knowledge\":[],\"title\":\"异步上传视频文件\"}",
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-kkQxKW30\">将视频文件通过连山云素材服务上传后获取到视频文件链接，再将获取到的连山云视频文件url作为入参的video_url通过素材库提供的视频上传接口进行文件上传</p><div data-type=\"qzcard\" data-value=\"data:%7B%22borderColor%22%3A%22%23fed4a4%22%2C%22backgroundColor%22%3A%22%23fff5eb%22%2C%22text%22%3A%22%3Cp%3E%3C%2Fp%3E%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22v9gpD%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22block%22%2C%22html%22%3A%22%3Cp%20data-id%3D%5C%22p838747a-jw0N0uLc%5C%22%3E%E4%BB%85%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%BC%80%E5%8F%91%E8%80%85%E8%B4%AD%E7%BD%AE%E8%BF%9E%E5%B1%B1%E4%BA%91%E7%B4%A0%E6%9D%90%E6%9C%8D%E5%8A%A1%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84tos%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5%2F%E8%BF%9E%E5%B1%B1%E7%82%B9%E6%92%AD%E4%BA%91%E4%BA%A7%E5%93%81%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5%E4%B8%8A%E4%BC%A0%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%8D%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81%E5%85%B6%E4%BB%96%E4%B8%89%E6%96%B9%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5%E5%9C%B0%E5%9D%80%3C%2Fp%3E%22%7D\"><div class=\"QZCard-container\" style=\"border-color: #fed4a4;background-color:#fff5eb;\"><div class=\"QZCard-icon\"><svg height=\"22\" p-id=\"13148\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" width=\"22\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M833.5 330.5C833.5 153 689.6 7.6 512 7.6S190.5 153 190.5 330.5c0 70.3 37.3 161 97.2 227.9 59.4 66.3 103.5 177.9 103.5 266.9v34.9h241.6v-34.6c0-89 44.1-200.4 103.2-266.9 60.1-67.6 97.5-166.4 97.5-228.2z\" fill=\"#FFC807\" p-id=\"13149\"></path><path d=\"M636.5 790.6l-193.9-268L596.4 202l199.2 266.4c-17.4 36.4-39.3 67.4-63.9 95.2C685.3 621 664.1 671.1 644 741l-7.5 49.6z\" fill=\"#FFB300\" p-id=\"13150\"></path><path d=\"M499.5 378.3h-82.7c-12.6 0-21.4-12.7-16.8-24.5l59.2-153c2.7-6.9 9.4-11.5 16.8-11.5h105c13.6 0 22.3 14.5 15.9 26.5l-81.5 153c-3.2 5.8-9.3 9.5-15.9 9.5z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13151\"></path><path d=\"M466.2 518.3l160-171c12-12.8 2.9-33.7-14.6-33.7h-105c-8.7 0-16.4 5.6-19.1 13.9l-55 171c-6.6 20.4 19.1 35.5 33.7 19.8z\" fill=\"#FFF8E1\" p-id=\"13152\"></path><path d=\"M593.6 1016.4H430.4c-5